# What clew looks at, and what it does with each file.
#
# scope glob kind format extract check
#
# Pinned so a row added, removed or re-aimed is visible in review. Provenance,
# `tool`, `last_verified` and `source`, is deliberately absent: re-dating a row
# after re-reading its documentation changes nothing a scan finds, and a
# snapshot that churned on it would stop being read.
#
# The revision below is what a scan is cited against. Raise it when a line
# changes, never when provenance does.

